{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight hordes of Covenant &amp; Flood in this new game mixing Roguelite\u00a0&amp; Bullet Heaven for hours of mindless fun!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Have fun surviving Spartan!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Spartan Survivors includes</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>10 playable levels</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>5 difficulty modes</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>21 weapons</strong> for a total of <strong>105 evolutions</strong> // <strong>14 perks</strong> with <strong>56 upgrades</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>8 playable characters</strong> with their unique weapons, perks &amp; stats</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock <strong>Custom Game</strong> to tailor the game the way you want to play it!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Halo Studios - Quote from the Director of Communication - June 2025</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;Really love to see the passion you and your team have poured into this experience - it really is fun and we look forward to getting further in our play through and unlocking more stuff.&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >More than 10 000 unique downloads!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Already available on Itchio since June 2025, Spartan Survivors reached <strong>more than 10 000 unique downloads</strong> with each and every day positive feedbacks, thank you all for your continued support!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3997630/extras/cc791c61aa9d778dbb494d900fa25856.avif?t=1758118802\" width=1440 height=810 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >------------</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\